#: ../../source/tutorials/index.rst:2
msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr "教程"

#: ../../source/tutorials/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"The tutorials cover small validation runs and larger SQD and solvation workflows. Run the H2 "
"examples before glycine, H3O+, or profiling scripts that require large amounts of memory."
msgstr "教程涵盖小规模验证，以及较大的 SQD 和溶剂化工作流。先运行 H2 示例，再尝试甘氨酸、H3O+ 或需要大量内存的剖析脚本。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"For fragment interactions, start with :doc:`fragment-interaction` to calculate the water-dimer "
"interaction energy. Continue with :doc:`fragment-report` to compare the methods and interpret the"
" resource estimates."
msgstr "对于片段相互作用，请先阅读 :doc:`fragment-interaction`，计算水二聚体相互作用能。再阅读 :doc:`fragment-report`，比较各方法并理解资源估计。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/index.rst:25
msgid "Optional Diagnostic Scripts"
msgstr "可选诊断脚本"

#: ../../source/tutorials/index.rst:27
msgid "Run these diagnostics after the first-run tutorials:"
msgstr "完成首次运行教程后，再运行这些诊断："

#: ../../source/tutorials/index.rst:29
msgid "``examples/qmmm/h3o_mc_solvation.py``: H3O+ ionic solvation, 16 GB+ RAM recommended."
msgstr "``examples/qmmm/h3o_mc_solvation.py``：H3O+ 离子溶剂化，建议至少 16 GB 内存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/index.rst:30
msgid ""
"``examples/qpe/h3o_8bit_qpe_benchmark.py``: high-precision H3O+ benchmark with fallback options, "
"30 GB+ RAM recommended."
msgstr "``examples/qpe/h3o_8bit_qpe_benchmark.py``：具有后备选项的高精度 H3O+ 基准，建议至少 30 GB 内存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/index.rst:32
msgid ""
"``examples/performance/h3o_dynamic_trotter_oom_scan.py``: memory-guarded dynamic Trotter scaling "
"scan."
msgstr "``examples/performance/h3o_dynamic_trotter_oom_scan.py``：具有内存保护的动态 Trotter 规模扫描。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/index.rst:34
msgid "``examples/performance/qpe_memory_profile.py``: compilation memory profiler."
msgstr "``examples/performance/qpe_memory_profile.py``：编译内存剖析。"
